  "_about": "a red kangaroo SCULPTED on its rig (2026-11-05, gen: scratchpad sc/prim/gen/kangaroo.py, written in its standing pose): a male, some 1.5 m standing, rust-red (agouti) over a pale belly; a pear tipped up -- the weight low in massive haunches, the chest narrow; short arms held in front, black-clawed; the hind legs folded as the IK folds them -- the thigh forward, a long slender shank back to the heel, and a FOOT longer still flat on the ground, its great fourth toe clawed; a deer's head with a long muzzle, a big dark nose pad, a pale malar stripe, side-set eyes and tall ears; the thick tail on the ground behind. It HOPS (hop.sync: index.html hopStep): both feet together, the stride locked to the bound (2026-11-08) The EARS are `fin` sheets (sharp.js): cupped, the rim exact, the inner colour inside a rim band, the base buried in the earB fillet. (2026-11-08, ears.py) The ears: tall cones of skin with ROUNDED tips, cupped deep toward the front, the far edge dark (`rim`, `rimAt`); the ball at the root gone, the root FAIRED into the head. (2026-11-08, tools/creaturegen/sweep/tails.py) The TAIL is one `sweep` (sculpt.js) along its bones, not a chain of cones blended one into the next: no beads, its thin end exact rings.",
